## MCP - LLM Intention

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/llm-intention

**Input:**
```json
{
  "query": "user message",
  "context": {
    "type": "recipe",
    "allowed_intents": ["recipe_search", "ingredient_info"],
    "min_score": 0.7,
    "auto_web_search": false
  },
  "plugin_context": {
    "api_keys": { "anthropic": "sk-ant-..." },
    "llm_model": "claude-3-haiku-20240307"
  },
  "user": { "user_id": "...", "guild_id": "..." }
}
```

**Output:**
- `is_relevant`: boolean
- `intent`: { type, confidence }
- `query_analysis`: { original, extracted_terms, ... }
- `qdrant`: { searched, results, best_score, above_threshold }
- `next_action`: "return_results" | "web_search" | "propose_web_search" | "reject"
- `message`: string or null

**auto_web_search:**
- `true` (default): next_action="web_search" si Qdrant insuffisant
- `false`: next_action="propose_web_search" (demande user)
